["tannaumi sāhasavaraṃ guruvaktragamyam", "ko'pyanuttaracidvyomasvabhāvo jayatādajaḥ", "pūjyapūjakapūjābhiḥ projjhitaṃ yannamāmi tat", "mahāvyomasamāviṣṭastisṭhāmyasminnirāvilaḥ", "saṃvidvikalpasaṃkalpaghaṭṭanaṃ naumyanuttaram", "kenāpi kriyate samyakparatattvopabṛṃhitā", "mahāsāhasavṛttyā svarūpalābhaḥ", "vakṣyamāṇakathitakrameṇā-dhigantavyaḥ", "satatamavasthitiḥ sthitetyarthaḥ", "ḥ", "prāptamahopadeśanāmāvirbhavatītyar-thaḥ", "yugmagrāsānniravakāśasaṃvinniṣṭhā", "nirupādhinīrūpaniḥsvarūpatādātmyaṃ bhavatītyarthaḥ", "siddhayoginīsaṃghaṭṭānmahāmelāpodayaḥ", "paramādvayasamāveśaḥ sarvatrāvasthita ityuktaṃ bhavati", "bhavatīti saṃbandhaḥ", "yathāmukhopadiṣṭanītyā svara eva prathate, - ityuktaṃ bhavati", "vigatabandhaṃ paraṃ brahma", "vibhātīti rahasyārthaḥ", "svaviśrāntyavasthitiḥ", "vasthitiḥ pañcamapadātiśāyinī niravakāśasaṃvinniṣṭhā sthitetyarthaḥ", "dvādaśavāhodayena mahāmarīcivikāsaḥ", "tayā sarvatra sarvataḥ sarvadaiva sthita iti mahāvākyārthaḥ", "caryāpañcakodaye nistaraṅgasamāveśaḥ", "caryāpañcakodayaḥ", "bandhamokṣobhayottīrṇamahāmuktiḥ karatalāmalakavat sthitetyarthaḥ", "prāptyā khasvaratā", "svena rāti vyāpnoti svīkaroti ādatte, - iti khasvaraḥ"]